{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioDocHeader",
  "$description": "The Document Header card (§3.2 ⑧) — the artefact's own header, drawn IN the stage, once per pane. A bar naming the collection and the page's route, a column of rows, the door to Search appearance and a disclosure listing the raw head tags. ONE row vocabulary: Title, the Layout picker and every schema-driven frontmatter field are the same `row`, discriminated by `kind`, because they differ in what they COMMIT rather than in what they look like — and what they commit is `panels/frontmatter-panel.ts`'s decision, reached by the row's `key`. Nothing here knows what a content collection is, which document it is drawing, or that a page has a route: the flow hands over rows whose every field is already a string and this draws them.",
  "tagName": "section",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "card",
    "aria-label": "Document header",
    "data-jx-region": "${state.region}",
    "data-placement": "${state.placement}"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The twelve `.doc-header*` rules from `styles/canvas.css` plus the row vocabulary the card used to borrow from `styles/inspector.css` (`.style-row`, `.style-row-label`, `.set-dot`) and `styles/overlays.css` (`.media-picker`, `.media-picker-thumb`). The borrowed ones are TRANSCRIBED rather than shared: the card is a document now and a class it does not emit cannot style it, and the three lit panels that still draw a `.style-row` go on owning those rules until they convert. Every `--spectrum-font-size-*` reference is re-pointed at the kit's scale — a document mounted in a pane's stage is outside `<sp-theme>`, so each of them would silently have taken its hard-coded fallback and stopped following the theme. And the PLACEMENT is an attribute rather than an ancestor class: `.doc-header-host.pinned .doc-header` reached in from the stage's own host, which a scoped style block cannot answer, so the stage's two placements arrive as `data-placement` and the card keys on itself.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "padding": "8px 12px 10px",
    "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
    "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
    "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "&[data-placement=\"pinned\"]": {
      "$description": "Design draws the artboards under a pan/zoom transform, so the card is pinned above the surface at 1:1 rather than sitting in the document's own column. Pinned it is a band, not a box: it spans the stage, so the box's border and radius would draw a card edge across a full-width strip.",
      "borderWidth": "0 0 1px",
      "borderRadius": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"bar\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "baseline",
      "gap": "8px",
      "paddingBottom": "6px"
    },
    "& [part=\"collection\"]": {
      "$description": "Which collection this document belongs to, or the word Document when it belongs to none. A label rather than a heading: the card has an `aria-label` of its own and the collection name is a fact about the document, not a section title.",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "letterSpacing": "0.06em",
      "textTransform": "uppercase",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"route\"]": {
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"fields\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "2px"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "$description": "§4.1's standard form row, stacked: the label sits above a control that takes the whole width. `min-width: 0` is what keeps it honest at a narrow stage (§4.6) — a field refuses to shrink below its own min-content without it, and the card is drawn inside a pane that can be half a window wide.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "stretch",
      "gap": "2px",
      "padding": "2px 0",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"row-label\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]": {
      "$description": "§4.2's set dot: a 6px accent dot, drawn only where the value is set here, that clears the value when it is pressed. It is a real `button` — it is pressable, and it is the row's only keyboard route to clearing — stripped of the chrome a button brings with it so the row still reads as a label with a dot beside it.",
      "width": "6px",
      "height": "6px",
      "padding": "0",
      "border": "none",
      "borderRadius": "50%",
      "background": "var(--accent)",
      "cursor": "pointer",
      "flexShrink": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]:hover": {
      "background": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row-name\"]": {
      "$description": "The visible label, and it is `aria-hidden` in the markup: every control in the row carries the same words as its own accessible name, so a label node in the tree as well would have each field announced twice. That is the trade the kit's naming makes — a control names itself — and it is also why this row needs no minted ids, which two panes drawing two cards would otherwise have to keep apart.",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"note\"]": {
      "$description": "What the row could not find out — the entries of a referenced collection that is empty, or the reason listing it failed. A sentence under the control, in the row's own label size, so it reads as part of the field rather than as an error banner.",
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"media\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"media\"] [part=\"widget\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"thumb\"]": {
      "width": "24px",
      "height": "24px",
      "objectFit": "cover",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "flexShrink": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"seo\"]": {
      "$description": "The door to Search appearance. It sits where the SEO disclosure used to, above Raw head tags — the same place in the reading order, one line instead of a block that could grow taller than the document it describes.",
      "display": "flex",
      "padding": "2px 0"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw\"] [part=\"summary\"]": {
      "padding": "4px 0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw\"] [part=\"summary\"]:hover": {
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw\"] [part=\"body\"]": {
      "padding": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw-empty\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "4px 0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw-list\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "2px",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "0",
      "listStyle": "none"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw-item\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "gap": "8px",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"raw-value\"]": {
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "header",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "bar"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "span",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "collection"
          },
          "textContent": "${state.collection}"
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "route-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/hasRoute"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "tagName": "code",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "route",
                "title": "This page's route"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.route}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "fields"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "$prototype": "Array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/state/rows"
          },
          "key": {
            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
          },
          "map": {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "row",
              "data-prop": "${$map.item.prop}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "row-label"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "chip-slot",
                      "role": "none"
                    },
                    "style": {
                      "display": "contents"
                    },
                    "$switch": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/isSet"
                    },
                    "cases": {
                      "true": {
                        "tagName": "button",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "chip",
                          "type": "button",
                          "title": "${$map.item.clearLabel}",
                          "aria-label": "${$map.item.clearLabel}"
                        },
                        "onclick": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/clear"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "row-name",
                      "aria-hidden": "true"
                    },
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "widget-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/kind"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "text": {
                    "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "widget"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                      "placeholder": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/placeholder"
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                      }
                    },
                    "oninput": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/editText"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/commitText"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "number": {
                    "tagName": "jx-number-field",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "widget"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                      "value": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/setNumber"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "boolean": {
                    "tagName": "jx-checkbox",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "widget"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                      "checked": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/checked"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/setBoolean"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "select": {
                    "tagName": "jx-select",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "widget"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                      "options": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/options"
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/setChoice"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "media": {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "media"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "div",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "thumb-slot",
                          "role": "none"
                        },
                        "style": {
                          "display": "contents"
                        },
                        "$switch": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/hasThumb"
                        },
                        "cases": {
                          "true": {
                            "tagName": "img",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "thumb",
                              "src": "${$map.item.thumb}",
                              "alt": ""
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "widget"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "size": "sm",
                          "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                          "placeholder": "/image.jpg",
                          "value": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                          }
                        },
                        "oninput": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/editText"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                },
                                {
                                  "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        "onchange": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/commitText"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                },
                                {
                                  "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "upload"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "size": "sm",
                          "quiet": true,
                          "icon": "upload-simple",
                          "label": "Upload media",
                          "hint": "Upload media"
                        },
                        "onclick": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/upload"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "browse"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "size": "sm",
                          "quiet": true,
                          "icon": "image",
                          "label": "Browse media",
                          "hint": "Browse media"
                        },
                        "onclick": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/browse"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                },
                                {
                                  "$ref": "event#/currentTarget"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "note-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/hasNote"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "true": {
                    "tagName": "p",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "note"
                    },
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.note}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "seo"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-action-button",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "seo-button"
          },
          "$props": {
            "size": "sm",
            "quiet": true,
            "icon": "magnifying-glass",
            "label": "Search appearance"
          },
          "onclick": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/openSeo"
                },
                "value": []
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "textContent": "Search appearance…"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-accordion-item",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "raw"
      },
      "$props": {
        "label": "Raw head tags",
        "open": {
          "$ref": "#/state/rawOpen"
        }
      },
      "ontoggle": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/setRawOpen"
            },
            "value": [
              {
                "$ref": "event#/detail"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "raw-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/rawState"
          },
          "cases": {
            "empty": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "raw-empty"
              },
              "textContent": "No custom head tags on this document."
            },
            "list": {
              "tagName": "ul",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "raw-list"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "$prototype": "Array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/rawEntries"
                  },
                  "key": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                  },
                  "map": {
                    "tagName": "li",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "raw-item"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "code",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "raw-key"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "raw-value",
                          "title": "${$map.item.value}"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.value}"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
